to let's take profit.

842
00:46:47,565 --> 00:46:48,290
Let's sell.

843
00:46:48,290 --> 00:46:49,670
Oh, I made $1000.

844
00:46:49,670 --> 00:46:51,170
I made $500.

845
00:46:51,170 --> 00:46:54,930
Let's go have a nice
meal or whatever.

846
00:46:54,930 --> 00:46:58,410
Buy an iPad.

847
00:46:58,410 --> 00:47:02,456
But when the stock loses money,
what's the natural tendency?

848
00:47:02,456 --> 00:47:04,910
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

849
00:47:04,910 --> 00:47:05,660
JAKE XIA: That's--

850
00:47:05,660 --> 00:47:06,990
AUDIENCE: [INAUDIBLE]

851
00:47:06,990 --> 00:47:08,390
JAKE XIA: I think natural
tendency, lot of people

852
00:47:08,390 --> 00:47:09,060
