894
00:49:37,130 --> 00:49:43,240
Choice B, you have 100%
chance to win $280.

895
00:49:43,240 --> 00:49:44,560
Who would choose choice A?

896
00:49:48,060 --> 00:49:50,510
Again, minority
of this audience.

897
00:49:50,510 --> 00:49:52,480
Let's say less than 10%.

898
00:49:52,480 --> 00:49:54,700
Who would choose choice B?

899
00:49:54,700 --> 00:49:56,370
The rest of you.

900
00:49:56,370 --> 00:49:59,120
All right.

