947
00:52:27,010 --> 00:52:31,344
When you try to trade on those,
how do you really build models?

948
00:52:31,344 --> 00:52:32,635
Is the market really efficient?

949
00:52:35,890 --> 00:52:37,660
What part is efficient?

950
00:52:37,660 --> 00:52:40,090
How do you really
apply those theories

951
00:52:40,090 --> 00:52:43,800
