953
00:52:45,470 --> 00:52:49,410
And sometimes, people
tend to oversimplify.

954
00:52:49,410 --> 00:52:51,640
Just say, oh, I can model this.

955
00:52:51,640 --> 00:52:54,030
This is one important parameter.

